    "body": "Root cause of the #448 false alarm. `--artifacts` defaults to `compiler::ART_PATH` = `/tmp/tless_artifacts.bin` (crates/uor-r4-core/src/transformerless/compiler.rs:1071) — a world-writable path that several of our scripts stage into and restore. Any concurrent run silently reads whatever container is there, and nothing in the output reveals it.\n\nTwo cheap fixes: (1) print the artifact κ on the induction line — it is already computed as `artifact_kappa`, and would have made this self-diagnosing at a glance; (2) reconsider the default: either require --artifacts explicitly, or default to a per-run path. Also worth auditing our helper scripts to stop the cp-in/cp-out staging pattern in favour of passing --artifacts explicitly.",
